results_*.json

# Experiment results (transient, regenerated per run) — root-level only
# NOTE: `/experiments/*` (contents), not `/experiments/` (the dir) — git cannot
# re-include anything under an excluded DIRECTORY, so the negation below only works
# if the directory itself is never excluded.
/experiments/*
# ...except the dfa1l sweep markers, which are RESUME STATE, not transient output:
# they tell the driver which of the 40 cells are already done. They used to live in
# /tmp and were being deleted mid-campaign by the macOS 5-day cleaner. Small JSONs,
# one per completed cell — version them so the sweep survives more than a reap.
!/experiments/dfa1l_markers/
# ...and the rescore output, which is the PAPER'S SOURCE OF TRUTH. Every cell run
# before 03/08/2026 logged its held-out triple through a refit address function
# (docs/threshold_misalignment_finding.md), so the marker triples are the BROKEN
# numbers and these are the corrected ones. They are not regenerable on a whim
# either: replaying a frozen winner needs the winner file AND box time, and the
# winners themselves live under the gitignored logs/. Losing this directory would
# mean re-running the campaign to recover the table.
!/experiments/rescore/
# l3dfeat probe markers — P1's measurements, same reasoning as dfa1l_markers.
!/experiments/l3dfeat_markers/
# P2/P3 chain markers, written by scripts/controller_arm_lib.sh.
!/experiments/p2_markers/
!/experiments/p3_markers/

